                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.00/833: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hall</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-07-02T16:00:00-04:00">July 2, 1930—4
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>65. Your 91, July 1, 4 p.m. In your discretion you may consent to publication of
                    your note declaring documents submitted to you forgeries.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
